            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked what test should limit the scope of permissible employment\u2011related questions, presenting an extreme hypothetical about diet, smoking, reading, hobbies, entertainment, and sexual practices."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "969b9f7f92feb3e68b234be0d899605cbae19588f26eac707e64daa047115472",
            "evidence_ids": [
