            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 47,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether private employers could ask similar questions and noted that a lower court had enjoined such a question."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "969b9f7f92feb3e68b234be0d899605cbae19588f26eac707e64daa047115472",
            "evidence_ids": [
