              "end": 51,
              "start": 50
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito repeatedly pressed the parties on the practicality of asking open\u2011ended questions and on whether drug\u2011treatment disclosures could be constitutionally required."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "969b9f7f92feb3e68b234be0d899605cbae19588f26eac707e64daa047115472",
            "evidence_ids": [
